{
    "title": "Last Hero: Shooter vs. Horde",
    "description": "<b>Last Hero</b> is a unique top-down shooter with roguelike elements. Our 3D PvE shooting game will plunge you into the bullet hell of the apocalypse. There are no allies, no mentors, no team\u2014just you, your powerful gun, and hordes of ferocious monsters and ruthless zombies. Your main mission is to shoot 'em up for the survival of humanity.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25 <b>TOP-DOWN SHOOTER</b>\r\nOur 3D PvE shooting game will immerse you in the bullet hell of the apocalypse, where you need to run and gun non-stop, mowing down waves of zombies alone. Increase your hero's chances of defense and survival by combining roguelite abilities acquired from killing monsters. Synergize powerful auto-guns with roguelike abilities to unleash a bulletstorm and deal devastating blows to hordes of enemies. Experience the thrill of our top-down shooter game, where spectacular and intense doomsday battles await at every turn.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca3 <b>UNIQUE HERO UPGRADE</b>\r\nIn this zombie shooting game, you can transform your last survivor into an invincible monster killer with a wide range of upgrades. The hero's upgrades directly affect how fast he can run and how accurately he can gun down zombies. Don't forget to upgrade the hero\u2019s equipment and guns, which are crucial in our apocalyptic shooter game. A huge arsenal of auto-guns for every taste and power will be available to you. Upgrading and combining roguelite skills will grant the last survivor unlimited power, enabling him to mow down waves of zombies by the hundreds.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25 <b>APOCALYPTIC ATMOSPHERE</b>\r\nOur top-down PvE shooter features a variety of mesmerizing and meticulously designed locations. Use the environment as a defense to turn the tide of combat from bullet hell to zombie hunting. Shoot hordes of zombies in the tight confines of an abandoned clinic. Mow down waves of hundreds of monsters at a nuclear power plant reactor in the bullet hell of the apocalypse. Kill a powerful boss in a deep nuclear mine. Shoot 'em up for the survival of humanity.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca3 <b>ENJOY THE SHOOTING GAME</b>\r\nEnjoy our free top-down PvE shooter game anytime, anywhere\u2014at work, on the subway, or in line. With intuitive one-handed controls and auto-aim shooting, you can easily mow down hordes of zombies whenever you want. The 3D polygon-style graphics enhance the apocalyptic atmosphere and spectacular PvE battles in our top-down action shooter game.\r\n\r\n<b>Last Hero</b> is a fun 3D shooting game with polygon-style graphics. Run and gun non-stop to destroy all waves of monsters and zombies in your way and complete your mission for the survival of humanity. The post-apocalypse has arrived; there is no turning back. Choose a powerful auto-gun and mow down endless waves of monsters and zombies in our top-down shooter with roguelike elements. Shoot 'em up before they tear your last survivor to pieces!\r\n\r\nImmerse yourself in the ultimate top-down action shooter experience as you fight for survival!\r\n<b>Contact email</b>: help@lasthero.xyz",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Last Hero</b> is a unique top-down shooter with roguelike elements. Our 3D PvE shooting game will plunge you into the bullet hell of the apocalypse. There are no allies, no mentors, no team\u2014just you, your powerful gun, and hordes of ferocious monsters and ruthless zombies. Your main mission is to shoot &#39;em up for the survival of humanity.<br><br>\ud83d\udd25 <b>TOP-DOWN SHOOTER</b><br>Our 3D PvE shooting game will immerse you in the bullet hell of the apocalypse, where you need to run and gun non-stop, mowing down waves of zombies alone. Increase your hero&#39;s chances of defense and survival by combining roguelite abilities acquired from killing monsters. Synergize powerful auto-guns with roguelike abilities to unleash a bulletstorm and deal devastating blows to hordes of enemies. Experience the thrill of our top-down shooter game, where spectacular and intense doomsday battles await at every turn.<br><br>\ud83d\udca3 <b>UNIQUE HERO UPGRADE</b><br>In this zombie shooting game, you can transform your last survivor into an invincible monster killer with a wide range of upgrades. The hero&#39;s upgrades directly affect how fast he can run and how accurately he can gun down zombies. Don&#39;t forget to upgrade the hero\u2019s equipment and guns, which are crucial in our apocalyptic shooter game. A huge arsenal of auto-guns for every taste and power will be available to you. Upgrading and combining roguelite skills will grant the last survivor unlimited power, enabling him to mow down waves of zombies by the hundreds.<br><br>\ud83d\udd25 <b>APOCALYPTIC ATMOSPHERE</b><br>Our top-down PvE shooter features a variety of mesmerizing and meticulously designed locations. Use the environment as a defense to turn the tide of combat from bullet hell to zombie hunting. Shoot hordes of zombies in the tight confines of an abandoned clinic. Mow down waves of hundreds of monsters at a nuclear power plant reactor in the bullet hell of the apocalypse. Kill a powerful boss in a deep nuclear mine. Shoot &#39;em up for the survival of humanity.<br><br>\ud83d\udca3 <b>ENJOY THE SHOOTING GAME</b><br>Enjoy our free top-down PvE shooter game anytime, anywhere\u2014at work, on the subway, or in line. With intuitive one-handed controls and auto-aim shooting, you can easily mow down hordes of zombies whenever you want. The 3D polygon-style graphics enhance the apocalyptic atmosphere and spectacular PvE battles in our top-down action shooter game.<br><br><b>Last Hero</b> is a fun 3D shooting game with polygon-style graphics. Run and gun non-stop to destroy all waves of monsters and zombies in your way and complete your mission for the survival of humanity. The post-apocalypse has arrived; there is no turning back. Choose a powerful auto-gun and mow down endless waves of monsters and zombies in our top-down shooter with roguelike elements. Shoot &#39;em up before they tear your last survivor to pieces!<br><br>Immerse yourself in the ultimate top-down action shooter experience as you fight for survival!<br><b>Contact email</b>: help@lasthero.xyz",
